{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "eb212a6f-c613-8d38-aa8e-c5fcb3a9ab4d",
  "created_at": "2026-03-04T12:28:54-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kathleen Lynch",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:27:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good afternoon, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:27:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, um, is this the Naval base housing office?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:27:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no, hon, this is the City Clerk at Newport City Hall. Who were you trying to reach?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:27:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The housing office. At the base. Housing office at the base. I thought that's what I dialed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:27:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, you've got the city instead. The base has its own offices, completely separate from us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:27:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Separate from us. Okay. So the number I have, it starts with a different area code than this one, I think? Is that, did I mess that up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:27:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, what area code do you have written down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:27:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have, um, it looks like it says four-oh-one, but I thought base numbers were, like, a different one. Aren't they?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:28:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one is all of Rhode Island, so that part's fine. It's probably the rest of the digits that got crossed. Is it a number you wrote down quickly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:28:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wrote down quickly. Yeah, off a sticky note. So four-oh-one is everybody. Huh. Okay, I thought that was the problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:28:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nope, not the area code. I'd look up the base housing office directly, maybe on the Navy's website, or ask the gate for the main line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:28:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The main line. Okay, the gate. I can do that. I just have to return a toaster, honestly. It burns everything. Even bagels come out black."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:28:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no, a toaster that burns everything. Well, that one's definitely going back. Hopefully the base people can point you the right way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:28:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right way, yeah. Sorry for bothering you. I'm still not sure why it came up as you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:28:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No bother at all. Good luck with the toaster, hon. Bye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:28:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
